{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119899","id":3774351864,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7g-An4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119899","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119899.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119899.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119899","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119899/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119899/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119899/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/36ea9f2718ec749822de434b4fb628f495e09ca2","number":119899,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add \"empty list\" check to `[br]` tag handler in `make_rst.py`","user":{"login":"MUmarShahbaz","id":68814294,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODE0Mjk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68814294?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUmarShahbaz","html_url":"https://github.com/MUmarShahbaz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUmarShahbaz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUmarShahbaz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUmarShahbaz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUmarShahbaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUmarShahbaz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUmarShahbaz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUmarShahbaz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUmarShahbaz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUmarShahbaz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nSuspected bug in XML to RST Conversion. The code breaks at `line 2315` of `make_rst.py` with an **index out of bounds error**. The the bug most likely occurs when a `[br]` tag is immediately followed by a newline.\r\n\r\nThere is no check for when the `post_text` array becomes empty and hence breaks the code.\r\n\r\nI have tested it on my own XML files successfully and did not encounter any errors.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI also noticed a mistake in the Godot documentation for creating your own doc-website using RST (over [here](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.html#publishing-documentation-online)).\r\n\r\nThe docs instruct us to download `version.py` and `make_rst.py` but not the local dependency `misc.utility.color` written at `line 17` of `make_rst.py`.\r\n\r\nI am making my own XML-to-RST converter which is simply a variant of this repo stripped down specifically for RST Conversion as a quick fix. You can find it at [MUmarShahbaz/Godot-XML-to-RST](https://github.com/MUmarShahbaz/Godot-XML-to-RST) if you want to reference it in the docs as a temporary (or permanent) fix.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos